<title>UK: World rubber stocks fell in February - IRSG.</title>
<headline>World rubber stocks fell in February - IRSG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>World stocks of natural and synthetic rubber fell in February 1997, both by 10,000 tonnes, according to the International Rubber Study Group.</p>
<p>   Data in thousand tonnes -- FEB'97   JAN'97    FEB'96</p>
<p>Natural production		  510	 610	 510</p>
<p>Natural consumption		 520	 540	 520</p>
<p>Natural stocks		    1,740     1,750     1,650</p>
<p>Synthetic production		820	 860	 780</p>
<p>Synthetic consumption	     830	 830	 810</p>
<p>Synthetic stocks		  2,380     2,390     2,380</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
</text>
